# Summary

The charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution.
[[cite:obs-aeba6c0a8cd206763a7df1508658dd706b1e74f3 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

The amount a member pays each year is one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January.
[[cite:obs-c819d67d18ebf0f59f7537dc39660ddd71b1b8da "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]